The underlying sources carry their own terms. The roll call file of Voeten, Strezhnev
and Bailey and the UN General Debate Corpus are released under CC0 on Harvard Dataverse.
The MINURSO tallies were read from UNSCR, an unofficial compilation that is not
affiliated with the United Nations.

